<body>
    <h1>Services Regional Pricing - Solution Design Overview=C2=A0</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong>Services Regional Pricing - Solution Design Overview</strong>&nb=
sp;</p>
<p><strong>Fortra | Salesforce Revenue Cloud</strong>&nbsp;</p>
<p><em>Document Version: 1.0 | Date: December 2025</em>&nbsp;</p>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p><strong>Executive Summary</strong>&nbsp;</p></li>
</ol>
<p>This document outlines the technical solution design for implementing Se=
rvices Regional Pricing in Salesforce Revenue Cloud. The solution addresses=
 the business requirement to adjust professional services pricing based on =
customer geography to account for market rate differences that exchange rat=
es do not fully capture.&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong>1.1 Business Objective</strong>&nbsp;</p>
<p>Implement automated regional pricing adjustments for Services products t=
hat apply multipliers ranging from 0.4 to 1.015 based on the customer's shi=
pping country. This ensures competitive and market-appropriate pricing acro=
ss 100+ countries while maintaining pricing transparency through Revenue Cl=
oud's native calculation details.&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong>1.2 Solution Approach</strong>&nbsp;</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Leverage Revenue Cloud's native Advanced Pricing Procedure framework&nbs=
p;</p></li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Create a Decision Table backed by Custom Metadata Type for regional mult=
ipliers&nbsp;</p></li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Insert pricing element immediately after List Price lookup&nbsp;</p></li=
>
</ul>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Apply rounding logic to nearest 5 currency units&nbsp;</p></li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Display adjustment details in Revenue Cloud's Calculation Details popup&=
nbsp;</p></li>
</ul>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<ol start=3D"2">
<li>
<p><strong>Solution Scope</strong>&nbsp;</p></li>
</ol>
<p><strong>2.1 In Scope</strong>&nbsp;</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Services products flagged with "Allow Regional Pricing" checkbox&nbsp;</=
p></li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li>
<p>New Quote and Amendment transaction types&nbsp;</p></li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Regional multiplier data for 100+ countries across APAC, Europe, LATAM, =
MEA, and North America&nbsp;</p></li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Integration with existing Revenue Cloud Pricing Procedures&nbsp;</p></li=
>
</ul>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Round-up pricing logic to nearest 5 units (all currencies)&nbsp;</p></li=
>
</ul>
<p><strong>2.2 Out of Scope</strong>&nbsp;</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Renewal transactions (existing asset price governs)&nbsp;</p></li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Cancellation transactions&nbsp;</p></li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Non-Services products&nbsp;</p></li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Modifications to existing currency conversion mechanisms (handled by Pri=
ce Book Entries)&nbsp;</p></li>
</ul>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<ol start=3D"3">
<li>
<p><strong>Technical Architecture</strong>&nbsp;</p></li>
</ol>
<p><strong>3.1 Architecture Overview</strong>&nbsp;</p>
<p>The solution leverages Revenue Cloud's native pricing framework to apply=
 regional adjustments as part of the standard pricing calculation flow. The=
 architecture ensures pricing transparency, maintainability, and performanc=
e.&nbsp;</p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"801879f0-7e13-4487-8c1a-e51=
90282762f" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#1b4f72" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-inverse">Component</span></stro=
ng><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-inverse">&nbsp;</span></p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#1b4f72" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-inverse">Description</span></st=
rong><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-inverse">&nbsp;</span></p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#f8f9fa" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Custom Metadata Type</strong>&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Services_Regional_Pricing__mdt stores country/multiplier mappings. Deplo=
yable, version-controlled, and cacheable for performance.&nbsp;</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Decision Table</strong>&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Advanced Decision Table references CMDT records. Provides lookup functio=
nality based on Quote shipping country.&nbsp;</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#f8f9fa" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Pricing Procedure Element</strong>&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>New element added to existing Pricing Procedure immediately after List P=
rice. Applies multiplier and rounding logic.&nbsp;</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Product2 Field</strong>&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Allow_Regional_Pricing__c checkbox determines eligibility for regional p=
ricing adjustment.&nbsp;</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p><strong>3.2 Data Flow</strong>&nbsp;</p>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p>User adds product to Quote&nbsp;</p></li>
</ol>
<ol start=3D"2">
<li>
<p>Pricing Procedure triggers&nbsp;</p></li>
</ol>
<ol start=3D"3">
<li>
<p>List Price Element retrieves base price from Price Book Entry (currency =
already converted)&nbsp;</p></li>
</ol>
<ol start=3D"4">
<li>
<p>Regional Pricing Element evaluates:&nbsp;</p></li>
</ol>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Checks Allow_Regional_Pricing__c =3D true&nbsp;</p></li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Retrieves ShippingCountry from Quote&nbsp;</p></li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Queries Decision Table for matching multiplier&nbsp;</p></li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Applies: AdjustedPrice =3D CEILING(ListPrice =C3=97 Multiplier / 5) =C3=
=97 5&nbsp;</p></li>
</ul>
<ol start=3D"5">
<li>
<p>Result flows to subsequent pricing elements and displays in Calculation =
Details&nbsp;</p></li>
</ol>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<ol start=3D"4">
<li>
<p><strong>Data Model</strong>&nbsp;</p></li>
</ol>
<p><strong>4.1 Custom Metadata Type: Services_Regional_Pricing__mdt</strong=
>&nbsp;</p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"380b7249-0095-471e-9e2b-2eb=
23d2ff624" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#1b4f72" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-inverse">Field Name</span></str=
ong><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-inverse">&nbsp;</span></p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#1b4f72" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-inverse">Type</span></strong><s=
pan class=3D"legacy-color-text-inverse">&nbsp;</span></p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#1b4f72" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-inverse">Description</span></st=
rong><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-inverse">&nbsp;</span></p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#f8f9fa" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Country__c&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Text(80)&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Country name (e.g., "Australia")&nbsp;</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Country_Code__c&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Text(3)&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>ISO country code for reliable matching&nbsp;</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#f8f9fa" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Region__c&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Text(50)&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Region (APAC, Europe, LATAM, MEA, North America)&nbsp;</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Subregion__c&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Text(50)&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Subregion (e.g., "Australia &amp; New Zealand")&nbsp;</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#f8f9fa" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Multiplier__c&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Number(4,3)&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Regional multiplier (e.g., 0.65)&nbsp;</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Is_Active__c&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Checkbox&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Enable/disable specific country rule&nbsp;</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#f8f9fa" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Effective_Start_Date__c&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Date&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Optional rule effective start date&nbsp;</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Effective_End_Date__c&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Date&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Optional rule effective end date&nbsp;</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p><strong>4.2 Regional Multiplier Summary</strong>&nbsp;</p>
