<p>&nbsp;</p>
<ol start=3D"5">
<li>
<p><strong>Risks and Mitigations</strong>&nbsp;</p></li>
</ol>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"420d059b-dfcf-427f-9a02-db8=
1615533c6" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#1b4f72" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-inverse">Risk</span></strong><s=
pan class=3D"legacy-color-text-inverse">&nbsp;</span></p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#1b4f72" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-inverse">Impact</span></strong>=
<span class=3D"legacy-color-text-inverse">&nbsp;</span></p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#1b4f72" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-inverse">Mitigation</span></str=
ong><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-inverse">&nbsp;</span></p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#f8f9fa" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Decision Table refresh lag&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Stale pricing data&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Configure automated refresh flow&nbsp;</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Incorrect country matching&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Wrong multiplier&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Use ISO country codes for matching&nbsp;</p></td>
</tr>
